{
  "key": "letter-080-part-02",
  "number": 80,
  "generationId": "01a1e62e-b310-7913-8a7e-e26f60029570",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Please, stop and see!",
      "path": "audio/1970-80/11.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.058866
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "What are the animal instincts?",
      "path": "audio/1970-80/12.mp3",
      "start": 2.208526,
      "end": 3.3771430000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "What is low? and high?",
      "path": "audio/1970-80/13.mp3",
      "start": 4.439388,
      "end": 5.780476
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Whatever is, is - there is no high, no low.",
      "path": "audio/1970-80/14.mp3",
      "start": 6.863878,
      "end": 10.094263
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "What is animal?",
      "path": "audio/1970-80/15.mp3",
      "start": 11.202336,
      "end": 11.988957
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "What is divine?",
      "path": "audio/1970-80/16.mp3",
      "start": 13.092698,
      "end": 13.942789
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "So do not condemn, do not praise, nor condemn nor praise yourself: all differences are of the mind.",
      "path": "audio/1970-80/17.mp3",
      "start": 15.002109,
      "end": 21.190091000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "In truth no differences exist.",
      "path": "audio/1970-80/18.mp3",
      "start": 22.747279,
      "end": 24.716463
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "There, God and animal are one and the same; heaven and hell are just two sides of one coin; samsara and nirvana are two expressions of one unknown.",
      "path": "audio/1970-80/19.mp3",
      "start": 26.314626,
      "end": 35.392675999999994
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "And do not think about what I have said; if you think you will miss.",
      "path": "audio/1970-80/20.mp3",
      "start": 36.908866,
      "end": 40.36
    }
  ]
}
